| # | 단어 | 과거형 | 발음 | 의미 | 예시 문장 |
|---|------|--------|------|------|----------|
| 1 | **clean** | cleaned | /kliːn/ | 청소하다 | I clean my room. |
| 2 | **cook** | cooked | /kʊk/ | 요리하다 | She cooks dinner. |
| 3 | **eat** | ate | /iːt/ | 먹다 | I eat breakfast. |
| 4 | **sleep** | slept | /sliːp/ | 자다 | I sleep 8 hours. |
| 5 | **sit** | sat | /sɪt/ | 앉다 | I sit on the sofa. |
| 6 | **walk** | walked | /wɔːk/ | 걷다 | I walk around. |
